# Manual testing only

Do not use browser tools, snapshots, screenshots, or end-to-end UI automation to verify changes.

After coding, stop. The user tests the app manually. Do not open localhost in a browser, click through flows, or wait on visual verification before declaring work done.

CLI checks that stay in code (typecheck, lint, build, db scripts) are fine when they help the change.
